cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Varda in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Varda: visualization and analysis of raster data"
abstract: >-
  Varda is a desktop application for visualizing and analyzing hyperspectral
  and multispectral imagery: spectral plots, ROIs that work across images and
  coordinate systems, transforms, classifiers, band parameters and an
  endmember workflow (the Spectral Hourglass).
type: software
